scenario the receiver reports spoofing and navigation stops
describe The receiver's spoofing alarm alone reaches Untrusted, because it is
describe the one input that can see the correlator. Coming back is two holds,
describe not one: Untrusted climbs through Degraded, because the intermediate
describe state is what the interface shows while the evidence is re-earned.

at 0
  fix 3d
  pos 5000000 10000000
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 11 14
  hdop 90
  jam none
  spoof none
  expect trust trusted

at 3000
  fix 3d
  pos 5000005 10000005
  alt 42000
  acc 3600
  sats 11 14
  hdop 92
  jam none
  spoof critical
  expect trust untrusted
  expect reason receiver-spoofing
  expect validity valid              # the fix is still a fix; it is not trusted

at 8000
  fix 3d
  pos 5000010 10000010
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 11 14
  hdop 90
  jam none
  spoof none
  expect trust untrusted

at 13500
  fix 3d
  pos 5000015 10000015
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 12 15
  hdop 88
  jam none
  spoof none
  expect trust degraded

at 19000
  fix 3d
  pos 5000020 10000020
  alt 42000
  acc 3400
  sats 12 15
  hdop 87
  jam none
  spoof none
  expect trust trusted
